      "content": "Thanks for that. It's a decent start, but it's a bit too brief. Can you expand on the \"cons\" section? Specifically, I need more detail on the criticisms regarding the financial burden on the manufacturing sector and why some environmental groups think the escalation rate is too low. \n\nI'm looking at the draft now and the sentiment score is coming back at a 0.85. Like I said before, that's way too high for a neutral brief—it reads a bit like a press release for the bill rather than an objective analysis. Try to flesh out those criticisms more deeply so the report feels more grounded and less \"sunny.\"",
