      "content": "Critics argue that the modified tax structure risks imposing immediate, severe economic hardship across energy-intensive manufacturing operations, potentially leading to curtailments or relocation. Environmental groups maintain that the current escalation rate represents a demonstrable failure to adequately accelerate the necessary transition pace mandated by scientific consensus. They contend the legislation insufficiently threatens high polluters, effectively weakening its primary climate mandate. This language reflects a stronger, less mitigated portrayal of the bill's weaknesses.",
